{UTF-8}
{ Chapter 10: a coflow. Staff is a stock of people; Total Experience is a stock of person-months that travels with them. Average experience is the ratio. Starts in balance: 100 people with 92 months of experience on average. }
Base Hiring=
	1.25
	~	person/month
	~	Replaces leavers.
	|
Push Size=
	20
	~	person/month
	~	|
Push Start=
	6
	~	month
	~	|
Push Duration=
	3
	~	month
	~	|
Hiring=
	Base Hiring + Push Size * PULSE(Push Start, Push Duration)
	~	person/month
	~	|
Staff= INTEG(
	Hiring - Quits,
	100)
	~	person
	~	|
Quit Fraction=
	0.0125
	~	1/month
	~	Average tenure 80 months.
	|
Quits=
	Staff * Quit Fraction
	~	person/month
	~	|
Experience of Hires=
	12
	~	month
	~	Average prior experience of a new hire.
	|
Experience Gain=
	1
	~	dmnl
	~	One month of experience per month worked.
	|
Total Experience= INTEG(
	Experience Hired + Experience Gained - Experience Lost,
	9200)
	~	person*month
	~	Experience embodied in the staff.
	|
Experience Hired=
	Hiring * Experience of Hires
	~	person
	~	|
Experience Gained=
	Staff * Experience Gain
	~	person
	~	|
Experience Lost=
	Quits * Average Experience
	~	person
	~	Leavers take the average with them.
	|
Average Experience=
	ZIDZ(Total Experience, Staff)
	~	month
	~	|
INITIAL TIME = 0 ~ month ~ |
FINAL TIME = 60 ~ month ~ |
TIME STEP = 0.0625 ~ month ~ |
SAVEPER = 0.0625 ~ month ~ |
